# .review/ is a mixed directory: a few committed assets, plus per-run agent
# artifacts that are regenerated on every dispatch and must never be committed.
# Allowlist, not blocklist — a new artifact kind should default to ignored.

*

# Committed assets — real repo state, not run output.
!.gitignore
!baselines/
!baselines/**
!schemas/
!schemas/**
!typecheck-baseline.txt
